      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm...",
      "translation" : "嗯..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Tis a fine day it be.",
      "translation" : "今天天气真不错。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you have a moment to spare.",
      "translation" : "如果你有空的话，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Come here to me now, come here and I'll tell ya something.",
      "translation" : "过来一下，我告诉你一件事。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Go ahead.",
      "translation" : "请说。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "These past years I've come to see the world and each time the snakes have stolen me treasure.",
      "translation" : "这些年来我四处游历，每次出门，蛇都会偷走我的宝藏。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh?",
      "translation" : "哦？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ye fine folks of this land have been so gracious to recover me treasure again and again.",
      "translation" : "这片土地上的好心人一次又一次帮我找回宝藏，真是太感谢你们了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I've learned me lesson and will never forget how those vile snakes have wronged me.",
      "translation" : "我吸取了教训，永远不会忘记那些可恶的蛇是怎样害我的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What did you do?",
      "translation" : "你做了什么？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I made a safe place to hide me treasure.",
      "translation" : "我找了个安全的地方藏起宝藏。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hidden in a secret place the treasure would be safe until I returned to the world the following year.",
      "translation" : "把宝藏藏在秘密地点后，它就能安全地待在那里，直到我明年再次来到这个世界。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This year, I have made me journey to see the outside world once again.",
      "translation" : "今年我又踏上旅程，来看看外面的世界。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I traveled to me cache of gold I found it to be safe and undisturbed.",
      "translation" : "我去查看藏金处，发现宝藏安然无恙，没人动过。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I thought to meself, I am very clever to hide the treasure from the snakes.",
      "translation" : "我心想，自己真聪明，竟然能把宝藏藏起来，不让蛇找到。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh, but I was a fool still.",
      "translation" : "唉，可我还是太傻了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What happened?",
      "translation" : "发生什么事了？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "My hiding place was too clever.",
      "translation" : "我藏得太巧妙了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I pulled and I heaved and pushed, but the hiding place would not budge.",
      "translation" : "我又拉又推又使劲，可藏宝处纹丝不动。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So once again, I am without treasure this year.",
      "translation" : "所以今年我还是一无所有。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I have not even begun brewing me famous green ale on account of this mess.",
      "translation" : "出了这档子事，我连著名的绿啤酒都还没开始酿。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I will ask ye, will ya help get me treasure back?",
      "translation" : "我问你，愿意帮我找回宝藏吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sure, I can help you.",
      "translation" : "当然，我来帮你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm too busy.",
      "translation" : "我太忙了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Aye, I understand.",
      "translation" : "好吧，我理解。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Thank you for listening to me tale.",
      "translation" : "谢谢你听我讲完这段故事。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "To find my treasure it be true.",
      "translation" : "想找到我的宝藏，确有其事。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "To my treasure I give my secret to you.",
      "translation" : "我把秘密告诉你，带你找到宝藏。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So, listen well and make no omissions.",
      "translation" : "所以，仔细听着，别漏掉任何细节。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Make the journey to the city of magicians.",
      "translation" : "前往魔法师之城。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Over the bridge and across the water",
      "translation" : "越过桥梁，渡过水面"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Climb the mountain until north ye can travel no farther.",
      "translation" : "爬上山，直到无法再往北走。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Passed the stone steps set into the air.",
      "translation" : "经过悬在空中的石阶。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hidden in the mountain side, me treasure is there.",
      "translation" : "我的宝藏就藏在山壁里。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ye must find a way to break it open.",
      "translation" : "你得想办法把它炸开。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ye will need a mighty explosion to free the cache to be sure.",
      "translation" : "要取出藏匿的宝物，肯定得来一场威力巨大的爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ye might try some Firecrackers.",
      "translation" : "你可以试试鞭炮。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Course, Ye would need a great number of them, Ye would need at least ^FF0000200 Firecreackers^000000",
      "translation" : "当然，你得准备很多，至少需要^FF0000200个鞭炮^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Tis a fine day it be.",
      "translation" : "今天天气真不错。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Have you found me treasure yet, have you?",
      "translation" : "你找到我的宝藏了吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Me hiding spot is a might hard to crack.",
      "translation" : "我的藏身处可不容易打开。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ye might try some Firecrackers.",
      "translation" : "你可以试试鞭炮。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Course, Ye would need a great number of them, Ye would need at least ^FF0000200 Firecreackers^000000",
      "translation" : "当然，你得准备很多，至少需要^FF0000200个鞭炮^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I be understanding if you can't get to it to be sure to be sure.",
      "translation" : "如果你实在弄不开，我也能理解，真的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh, welcome back!",
      "translation" : "哦，欢迎回来！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Thank you for returning me treasure!",
      "translation" : "谢谢你把我的宝藏带回来！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Me gratitude knows no bounds!",
      "translation" : "我感激不尽！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I am so happy,",
      "translation" : "我真高兴，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll be starting up me brew right away",
      "translation" : "这就马上开始酿酒。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It seems that the snakes have returned this year and are here to steal my treasure again.",
      "translation" : "看来今年蛇又来了，还想再偷我的宝藏。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The snakes carry the coins of my kinsmen and must be punished.",
      "translation" : "蛇偷走了我族人的硬币，必须惩罚它们。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But ye have had a long journey, for which I am very grateful.",
      "translation" : "不过你一路奔波，我非常感激。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "When ye have had a moment to rest ye legs, come talk to me again and we may speak again",
      "translation" : "等你休息一会儿、让双腿恢复后，再来和我聊聊。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah, well rested I hope?",
      "translation" : "啊，休息得还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Thank you for coming by again.",
      "translation" : "谢谢你又来看我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The snakes carry the coins of my kindsmen and must be punished.",
      "translation" : "蛇偷走了我族人的硬币，必须惩罚它们。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Anxious Leprechaun",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[O'Riley the Leprechaun]",
      "translation" : "[妖精奥莱利]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
